Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:01.36,Short,,0,0,0,,When your cat rolls over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:02.78,Short,,0,0,0,,and shows you its belly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:03.70,Short,,0,0,0,,it's not asking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:04.60,Short,,0,0,0,,for a rub
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:05.52,Short,,0,0,0,,It's telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:06.58,Short,,0,0,0,,it feels safe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.93,0:00:07.66,Short,,0,0,0,,The belly holds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:08.90,Short,,0,0,0,,all the soft
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:09.84,Short,,0,0,0,,important organs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:10.68,Short,,0,0,0,,with no ribs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:11.50,Short,,0,0,0,,to protect them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.00,Short,,0,0,0,,so a cat only shows it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.16,Short,,0,0,0,,to someone it trusts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:15.18,Short,,0,0,0,,But touch it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.16,Short,,0,0,0,,and an old reflex
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.10,Short,,0,0,0,,kicks in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:18.82,Short,,0,0,0,,The front paws grab
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:19.84,Short,,0,0,0,,the claws come out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:20.95,Short,,0,0,0,,and the back legs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:22.02,Short,,0,0,0,,kick like a rabbit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:23.16,Short,,0,0,0,,On its back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.02,Short,,0,0,0,,a cat can fight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:25.18,Short,,0,0,0,,with all four paws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:25.74,Short,,0,0,0,,at once
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:27.10,Short,,0,0,0,,So it's not a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:28.47,Short,,0,0,0,,It's a compliment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:29.50,Short,,0,0,0,,Scratch its chin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.22,Short,,0,0,0,,instead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:31.62,Short,,0,0,0,,And if it flops over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:32.74,Short,,0,0,0,,in front of you again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:33.64,Short,,0,0,0,,just say thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:34.00,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.74,0:00:30.35,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho still falls for the belly trap
